OL,3,GNEWSASunderland fans ready for
OL,4,A'raucous' Europe return
OL,5,
OL,6,FSunderland fans are gearing up for a
OL,7,F"raucous" return to European football
OL,8,Fafter a 53-year wait.
OL,10,FThe Europa League tie against AZ
OL,11,FAlkmaar kicks off at the Stadium of
OL,12,FLight at 20:00 BST, with both local and
OL,13,FDutch fans descending on the city for
OL,14,Fthe opening match.
OL,16,FFan Colin Lynch, 54, from
OL,17,FChester-le-Street, County Durham, said:
OL,18,F"It's been a journey, I never thought
OL,19,Fit was going to happen but it is. I'm
OL,20,Fsmiling from ear to ear."
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
