OL,3,GNEWSASunderland fans ready for
OL,4,A'raucous' Europe return
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Simon Haley, 39, from
OL,7,FDurham, said: "It's going to break
OL,8,Fdecibel records when they walk out... I
OL,9,Freckon they'll hear it in Shields."
